Gemini Spark is now available to all Google AI Ultra subscribers in the U.S. It can handle complex tasks and connect different parts of your digital ecosystem to take action where it matters most. Whether you watch it work or let it run in the background, Gemini Spark operates under your direction.

Give it a try at or in the app and share your feedback.

@GeminiApp: "Gemini Spark is your new 24/7 personal AI agent. Give it a task and it works autonomously in the background, even if your phone and laptop are turned off. You can choose to turn it on, and it is designed to check with you before taking major actions."

This speed is incredible, especially considering it runs completely sandboxed in the browser with all data kept local.

@xenovacom shares a demo showing that before Fable 5 was shut down, it pushed Gemma 4 to 255 tokens per second on WebGPU, which some people doubted was real. Now, the demo and kernels are available for local execution in your browser.

Agentic kernel optimization is seen as the future of on-device inference, enabling fast, private AI processing without relying on external servers.

